          "@type": "VideoObject",
          "contentUrl": "https://content.jwplatform.com/videos/hYPRkB9Q-K3AjnAEN.mp4",
          "description": " In this video, we'll show you how to make a delicious bread dipping oil that's perfect for dipping chunks of Italian or French bread into. This bread dipping oil is made with a mixture of oil, parsley, basil, garlic, thyme, oregano, rosemary, pepper, and parmesan cheese, and it's a great way to add flavor to your bread. Simply mix all of the ingredients together and let the flavors infuse for a few minutes. Then, pour the oil into a dipping dish and enjoy with your favorite bread. It's a simple and tasty way to elevate your bread game, and it's sure to become a favorite at your next dinner party or gathering.",
