              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Katherine"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was excellent and I made as directed. Everyone loved it and I used it with this crusty chewy italian bread. Excellent recipe!! I added everything to a jar and shook it up. No fuss no muss....",
            "datePublished": "2020-08-09T18:51:20.597Z"
